---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Colophon" description="Credits for the artworks, type and tools used on the Conceptual Studio website.">
  <section class="page-head wrap grid"><h1>Colophon</h1><p class="lead">How this site was made, and the paintings it borrows.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap grid text-page">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Artworks</h2>
      <ul class="credits">
        <li><strong>François Lemoyne, The Apotheosis of Hercules, 1731–1736.</strong> Ceiling of the Salon d’Hercule, Palace of Versailles. Public domain.</li>
        <li><strong>François Boucher, The Chinese Garden, 1742.</strong> Public domain.</li>
        <li><strong>Gerard de Lairesse (1640–1711), Allegory of the Sciences.</strong> Shown in gold in the footer. Public domain.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Type</h2>
      <p>Headings are set in Agatho Medium by Andrii Shevchyk (andfonts), used under a commercial licence. Everything else is set in Inter by Rasmus Andersson, under the SIL Open Font License.</p>
      <h2>Built with</h2>
      <p>Astro, GSAP and plain CSS. The glass over the paintings adapts the shader from liquid-glass-js by Armagan Amcalar (MIT licence). Hosted on Cloudflare Pages.</p>
      <h2>Data</h2>
      <p>The live chart uses Department for Education figures from Further education and skills, academic year 2025/26, published 16 July 2026.</p>
      <p>Designed and written by Joshua McDonald.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
